      "shortDescription": "E+E Elektronik develops and manufactures sensors, transmitters and hand-held instruments for humidity, dew point, oil moisture, carbon dioxide, air velocity, flow, pressure and temperature. Its portfolio also includes humidity calibration systems and accredited calibration services for industrial, HVAC and environmental measurement.",
      "fullDescription": [
        "E+E Elektronik Ges.m.b.H. is an Austrian measurement-technology manufacturer founded in 1979 and based in Engerwitzdorf. DR. JOHANNES HEIDENHAIN GmbH acquired the company in 1994, while E+E continues to operate as a specialist sensor brand.",
        "Official product sources document sensing elements, probes, transmitters and hand-held instruments for humidity, dew point, moisture in oil, carbon dioxide, air velocity, gas flow, differential pressure and temperature. The range also includes data loggers and humidity calibration systems. E+E operates an accredited calibration laboratory, and its measurement technologies are applied across building automation and HVAC, process and plant engineering, food and beverage production, pharmaceuticals, energy, petrochemicals, meteorology and industrial instrumentation."
      ],
