      "shortDescription": "elobau develops contactless sensor and control solutions for mobile machinery and industrial automation. Its portfolio covers operator controls, machine-safety systems, level measurement, and position, angle and tilt sensors.",
      "fullDescription": [
        "elobau GmbH & Co. KG is a German sensor and control-technology manufacturer founded in 1972 and based in Leutkirch im Allgäu. The company began with a magnetic reed-contact proximity switch and continues to develop contactless sensing and customised control systems.",
        "Official product sources document joysticks, multifunction handles, modular armrests and steering-column controls for off-highway machinery. The industrial range includes magnetic and RFID safety sensors, safety interlocks, emergency-stop devices, relays, I/O modules and configurable safety controllers. elobau also supplies float switches and continuous level-measurement systems, together with proximity, angle and tilt sensors for mobile and industrial applications."
      ],
